\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I'm not ashamed to own my Lord,
\par Or to defend His cause,
\par Maintain the honour of His word,
\par The glory of His Cross.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus, my God! I know His name,
\par His name is all my trust;
\par Nor will He put my soul to shame,
\par Nor let my hope be lost.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Firm as His throne His promise stands,
\par And He can well secure
\par What I've committed to His hands
\par Till the decisive hour.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Then will He own my worthless name
\par Before His Father's face,
\par And in the new Jerusalem
\par Appoint my soul a place.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

